":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["McCoy-Oni resembles the Italian exclamation from Rome \"mecojoni\" which translates to \"my testicles,\" a way to convey surprise in a friendly way."]},{"c":["This is a reference to Japanese myths revolving around the ",{"t":"bake-danuki","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bake-danuki"},", a ",{"t":"yōkai","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Y%C5%8Dkai"}," which are commonly portrayed as having oversized testicles which may be carried slung over their shoulder, just as depicted in McCoy-Oni's character art."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}